{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium, compact **infinite scrolling benefits strip for Soluna**, closely inspired by the attached reference image.
    
    IMPORTANT: Create this as **one single Shopify section**.
    
    ## DESIGN
    
    Create a slim, full-width horizontal scrolling strip with a **black background by default**.
    
    The section should contain multiple benefit items moving continuously from right to left.
    
    Each item should consist of:
    
    **Icon/Image + Short Text**
    
    For example:
    
    **[Icon] Restorative Routines**
    **[Icon] Infrared Warmth**
    **[Icon] UK Support**
    **[Icon] Premium Craftsmanship**
    
    Keep the design minimal, clean and sophisticated.
    
    The section should feel like a premium brand information ticker rather than a standard announcement bar.
    
    ## CONTENT
    
    Allow up to **7 individual scrolling items**.
    
    Each item should have:
    
    * Enable/disable setting
    * Editable short text
    * Image/icon picker
    * Optional link
    * Icon/image size control
    
    The merchant should be able to upload a custom image or icon for every item.
    
    If no image is uploaded, allow an optional default icon to be displayed.
    
    Keep the text short so the strip remains compact.
    
    ## DEFAULT CONTENT
    
    Use these as the initial example items:
    
    1. Restorative Routines
    2. Infrared Warmth
    3. Traditional Sauna
    4. Cold Water Recovery
    5. Premium Craftsmanship
    6. Bespoke Wellness
    7. Dedicated UK Support
    
    All of these must be editable through the Shopify Theme Editor.
    
    ## INFINITE SCROLL
    
    IMPORTANT:
    
    The items should continuously scroll horizontally from **right to left** in an infinite loop.
    
    There should be no visible beginning or end to the animation.
    
    When the final item leaves the screen, the sequence should seamlessly continue from the first item.
    
    Do not allow a blank gap to appear during the loop.
    
    Duplicate the item sequence behind the scenes if necessary to create a seamless infinite marquee.
    
    ## SCROLL SPEED
    
    Add a Shopify Theme Editor setting that allows the merchant to control the scrolling speed.
    
    Provide a simple range slider such as:
    
    **Slow → Fast**
    
    Allow the speed to be adjusted without editing code.
    
    The default speed should be **moderate and elegant**, not fast or distracting.
    
    The animation should move continuously rather than jumping from item to item.
    
    ## SPACING
    
    Keep the strip compact.
    
    Use consistent spacing between each benefit item.
    
    Each item should have:
    
    * Icon/image
    * Small gap
    * Text
    * Generous gap before the next item
    
    Do not allow items to become visually crowded.
    
    The overall section should remain relatively short in height.
    
    ## COLOURS
    
    Default:
    
    **Background:** Black
    
    **Text:** White
    
    **Icon/image:** White or light/monochrome appearance where possible
    
    Add Theme Editor controls for:
    
    * Background colour
    * Text colour
    * Icon/image treatment where supported
    * Item spacing
    * Section height
    * Icon size
    * Text size
    
    ## RESPONSIVE DESIGN
    
    The strip must work beautifully across desktop, tablet and mobile.
    
    On desktop:
    
    Display multiple items across the screen.
    
    On mobile:
    
    Keep the section compact and allow the same continuous horizontal animation.
    
    Do NOT stack the items vertically.
    
    Do NOT turn this into a swipe carousel.
    
    The scrolling animation should continue automatically on mobile.
    
    Reduce:
    
    * Icon size
    * Text size
    * Item spacing
    * Section height
    
    appropriately for smaller screens.
    
    ## ANIMATION
    
    The animation must be:
    
    * Continuous
    * Smooth
    * Linear
    * Seamless
    * Infinite
    
    Avoid easing that causes the ticker to speed up or slow down.
    
    Use a consistent scrolling speed throughout the animation.
    
    Pause the animation on hover if this is enabled, but make this an optional Theme Editor setting.
    
    Add an optional setting for:
    
    **Pause scrolling on hover: Yes / No**
    
    ## TYPOGRAPHY
    
    Use clean, modern typography consistent with the Soluna store.
    
    The text should be short, legible and refined.
    
    Avoid oversized typography.
    
    The icon and text should feel visually balanced.
    
    ## TECHNICAL REQUIREMENTS
    
    * Shopify Liquid
    * HTML
    * CSS
    * Vanilla JavaScript only
    * No external libraries
    * Fully responsive
    * Compatible with Shopify Theme Editor
    * Up to 7 editable blocks
    * Each block must support an image/icon and text
    * Enable/disable individual blocks
    * Adjustable scrolling speed
    * Optional pause-on-hover
    * Infinite seamless loop
    * No blank spaces during the animation
    * No page-level horizontal overflow
    * Scope all CSS and JavaScript specifically to this section
    * Do not interfere with other Shopify sections
    * Optimise for fast loading
    
    ## FINAL VISUAL DIRECTION
    
    The final section should closely resemble the supplied reference:
    
    **Black full-width background → white icon → short white text → generous spacing → next icon/text → continuous horizontal movement.**
    
    Keep it **compact, understated and premium**.
    
    It should act as a subtle visual divider between sections while reinforcing Soluna's key brand benefits without overwhelming the visitor.
    , Give me option to increase the height up to 150
    Give me the controls separately for mobile and computer mode, Make the image size 90 pixels by default with an option to increase or decrease. 
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% style %}.ai-benefits-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;width:100%;overflow:hidden;background:{{ block.settings.background_color }};color:{{ block.settings.text_color }}}.ai-benefits-{{ ai_gen_id }}__viewport{width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;max-width:100%;height:{{ block.settings.desktop_height }}px;display:flex;align-items:center;overflow:hidden;margin:0 auto}.ai-benefits-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track{display:flex;flex:none;width:max-content;animation:ai-benefits-scroll-{{ ai_gen_id }} {{ block.settings.scroll_speed }}s linear infinite}.ai-benefits-{{ ai_gen_id }}__group{display:flex;align-items:center;flex:none}.ai-benefits-{{ ai_gen_id }}__item{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:{{ block.settings.desktop_icon_gap }}px;margin-right:{{ block.settings.desktop_item_spacing }}px;white-space:nowrap;color:{{ block.settings.text_color }};text-decoration:none}.ai-benefits-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon{width:{{ block.settings.desktop_icon_size }}px;height:{{ block.settings.desktop_icon_size }}px;object-fit:contain;flex:none}{% if block.settings.monochrome_icons %}.ai-benefits-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon{filter:grayscale(1) brightness(0) invert(1)}{% endif %}.ai-benefits-{{ ai_gen_id }}__fallback{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:{{ block.settings.desktop_icon_size }}px;height:{{ block.settings.desktop_icon_size }}px;font-size:{{ block.settings.desktop_icon_size | times: 0.8 }}px;color:{{ block.settings.text_color }}}.ai-benefits-{{ ai_gen_id }}__text{font-family:{{ block.settings.text_font.family }};font-size:{{ block.settings.desktop_text_size }}px;letter-spacing:{{ block.settings.letter_spacing }}px;line-height:1.2}@keyframes ai-benefits-scroll-{{ ai_gen_id }}{from{transform:translate3d(0,0,0)}to{transform:translate3d(-50%,0,0)}}{% if block.settings.pause_on_hover %}.ai-benefits-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-benefits-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track{animation-play-state:paused}{% endif %}@media(max-width:749px){.ai-benefits-{{ ai_gen_id }}__viewport{width:100%;height:{{ block.settings.mobile_height }}px}.ai-benefits-{{ ai_gen_id }}__item{gap:{{ block.settings.mobile_icon_gap }}px;margin-right:{{ block.settings.mobile_item_spacing }}px}.ai-benefits-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon,.ai-benefits-{{ ai_gen_id }}__fallback{width:{{ block.settings.mobile_icon_size }}px;height:{{ block.settings.mobile_icon_size }}px}.ai-benefits-{{ ai_gen_id }}__text{font-size:{{ block.settings.mobile_text_size }}px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ai-benefits-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track{animation-play-state:paused}}{% endstyle %}
<infinite-benefits-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-benefits-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}><div class="ai-benefits-{{ ai_gen_id }}__viewport" aria-label="{{ block.settings.aria_label | escape }}"><div class="ai-benefits-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track">{% for copy in (1..2) %}<div class="ai-benefits-{{ ai_gen_id }}__group"{% if copy == 2 %} aria-hidden="true"{% endif %}>{% for i in (1..7) %}{% assign enabled_key = 'item_' | append: i | append: '_enabled' %}{% assign text_key = 'item_' | append: i | append: '_text' %}{% assign image_key = 'item_' | append: i | append: '_image' %}{% assign link_key = 'item_' | append: i | append: '_link' %}{% assign enabled = block.settings[enabled_key] %}{% assign item_text = block.settings[text_key] %}{% assign item_image = block.settings[image_key] %}{% assign item_link = block.settings[link_key] %}{% if enabled and item_text != blank %}{% if item_link != blank %}<a class="ai-benefits-{{ ai_gen_id }}__item" href="{{ item_link }}">{% else %}<span class="ai-benefits-{{ ai_gen_id }}__item">{% endif %}{% if item_image %}<img class="ai-benefits-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon" src="{{ item_image | image_url: width: 300 }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{% else %}<span class="ai-benefits-{{ ai_gen_id }}__fallback" aria-hidden="true">✦</span>{% endif %}<span class="ai-benefits-{{ ai_gen_id }}__text">{{ item_text | escape }}</span>{% if item_link != blank %}</a>{% else %}</span>{% endif %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>{% endfor %}</div></div></infinite-benefits-{{ ai_gen_id }}>
{% schema %}{"name":"Soluna benefits strip","tag":null,"class":"soluna-benefits-strip","settings":[{"type":"range","id":"desktop_width_percent","label":"Desktop width","min":50,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100},{"type":"range","id":"desktop_height","label":"Desktop height","min":30,"max":150,"step":10,"unit":"px","default":60},{"type":"range","id":"mobile_height","label":"Mobile height","min":30,"max":150,"step":10,"unit":"px","default":50},{"type":"range","id":"scroll_speed","label":"Scroll speed","min":20,"max":120,"step":10,"unit":"s","default":60},{"type":"checkbox","id":"pause_on_hover","label":"Pause on hover","default":true},{"type":"checkbox","id":"monochrome_icons","label":"Monochrome images","default":true},{"type":"text","id":"aria_label","label":"Accessibility label","default":"Store benefits"},{"type":"range","id":"desktop_icon_size","label":"Desktop image size","min":10,"max":150,"step":10,"unit":"px","default":90},{"type":"range","id":"desktop_text_size","label":"Desktop text size","min":11,"max":20,"step":1,"unit":"px","default":14},{"type":"range","id":"desktop_icon_gap","label":"Desktop icon gap","min":4,"max":24,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":8},{"type":"range","id":"desktop_item_spacing","label":"Desktop item spacing","min":24,"max":140,"step":4,"unit":"px","default":72},{"type":"range","id":"mobile_icon_size","label":"Mobile image size","min":10,"max":150,"step":10,"unit":"px","default":90},{"type":"range","id":"mobile_text_size","label":"Mobile text size","min":10,"max":18,"step":1,"unit":"px","default":12},{"type":"range","id":"mobile_icon_gap","label":"Mobile icon gap","min":4,"max":20,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":6},{"type":"range","id":"mobile_item_spacing","label":"Mobile item spacing","min":18,"max":100,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":48},{"type":"range","id":"letter_spacing","label":"Letter spacing","min":-1,"max":3,"step":0.5,"unit":"px","default":0},{"type":"font_picker","id":"text_font","label":"Text font","default":"helvetica_n4"},{"type":"color","id":"background_color","label":"Background","default":"#000000"},{"type":"color","id":"text_color","label":"Text and icon","default":"#FFFFFF"},{"type":"header","content":"Benefit 1"},{"type":"checkbox","id":"item_1_enabled","label":"Enable","default":true},{"type":"text","id":"item_1_text","label":"Text","default":"Restorative Routines"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"item_1_image","label":"Image or icon"},{"type":"url","id":"item_1_link","label":"Link"},{"type":"header","content":"Benefit 2"},{"type":"checkbox","id":"item_2_enabled","label":"Enable","default":true},{"type":"text","id":"item_2_text","label":"Text","default":"Infrared Warmth"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"item_2_image","label":"Image or icon"},{"type":"url","id":"item_2_link","label":"Link"},{"type":"header","content":"Benefit 3"},{"type":"checkbox","id":"item_3_enabled","label":"Enable","default":true},{"type":"text","id":"item_3_text","label":"Text","default":"Traditional Sauna"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"item_3_image","label":"Image or icon"},{"type":"url","id":"item_3_link","label":"Link"},{"type":"header","content":"Benefit 4"},{"type":"checkbox","id":"item_4_enabled","label":"Enable","default":true},{"type":"text","id":"item_4_text","label":"Text","default":"Cold Water Recovery"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"item_4_image","label":"Image or icon"},{"type":"url","id":"item_4_link","label":"Link"},{"type":"header","content":"Benefit 5"},{"type":"checkbox","id":"item_5_enabled","label":"Enable","default":true},{"type":"text","id":"item_5_text","label":"Text","default":"Premium Craftsmanship"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"item_5_image","label":"Image or icon"},{"type":"url","id":"item_5_link","label":"Link"},{"type":"header","content":"Benefit 6"},{"type":"checkbox","id":"item_6_enabled","label":"Enable","default":true},{"type":"text","id":"item_6_text","label":"Text","default":"Bespoke Wellness"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"item_6_image","label":"Image or icon"},{"type":"url","id":"item_6_link","label":"Link"},{"type":"header","content":"Benefit 7"},{"type":"checkbox","id":"item_7_enabled","label":"Enable","default":true},{"type":"text","id":"item_7_text","label":"Text","default":"Dedicated UK Support"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"item_7_image","label":"Image or icon"},{"type":"url","id":"item_7_link","label":"Link"}],"presets":[{"name":"Soluna benefits strip"}]}
